### Test SLA Simple Debug
### Probar endpoints simples para aislar el problema

### 1. Test ping simple
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla-test/ping
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test base de datos simple
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla-test/db-test
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test endpoint SLA original (para comparar)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla
Accept: application/json

### 4. Test endpoint SLA activas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla/activas
Accept: application/json

